---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About - Eran Gamage">
  <section class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
    <p class="eyebrow">Background</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl">About</h1>
    <p class="muted-copy">
      I am a data science master's student and physics graduate. My work sits around applied machine learning, retrieval systems, evaluation, and data-heavy research problems.
    </p>
    <p class="muted-copy">
      Recent work includes RAG evaluation, NLP workflows, Australian electricity grid analytics with AEMO and NEM data, privacy-preserving retrieval ideas, and drought modelling with climate indices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="card">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Research interests</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
        <li>Retrieval-augmented generation and evaluation.</li>
        <li>Energy demand, dispatch, and grid data analysis.</li>
        <li>Private retrieval, proofs, and zero-knowledge adjacent systems.</li>
        <li>Climate and drought modelling.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Working style</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 muted-copy">
        I prefer simple baselines, reproducible pipelines, clearly stated assumptions, and evaluation that can be inspected rather than only summarized.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
